## Publications

Dan Somers has authored or co-authored numerous technical reports and journal
articles. Categories include:

### Horizontal-Axis Wind Turbines (22 publications)
Key reports include design and experimental results for the S801-S829 airfoil
series, published through NREL and SERI. Many are freely available as PDFs
with DOI links at {{ site.url }}/publications/.

### General Aviation Aircraft (8 publications)
Including NASA Technical Papers on natural-laminar-flow airfoils (TP-1861,
TP-1865) and journal articles in the Journal of Aircraft.

### Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (4 publications)
Co-authored with Mark D. Maughmer on high-altitude, long-endurance airfoils.

### Sailplanes (6 publications)
Including the SM701 airfoil and NASA research related to sailplane airfoils.

### Airfoil Design and Analysis Methods (5 publications)
Including the Eppler code documentation (NASA TM-80210, TM-81862) and papers
on low-speed airfoil design methodology.

